{
  "slug": "spc-tools",
  "name": "Spc Tools",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "SPC Tools gives Claude a calibrated, comprehensive statistical process control toolkit with pure-JavaScript visualization. Covers standard techniques (control charts, Cpk, Gage R&R) as well as Bayesian and distribution-free methods. No dependencies required; computation is pure Python, charts are zero-dependency ChartSpec JSON rendered client-side.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `capability` (Run process capability analysis), `control-chart` (Create SPC control charts from data), `gage-rr` (Run Gage R&R measurement system analysis), `spc-spec` (Forge quality engineering toolkit reference)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install spc-tools@claude-community` from `ewolters/spc-tools`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "hook": 1
  },
